# 3. CORE APPLICATION CONCEPT

Build the application around three main concepts:

A. USER

Every person has an individual account.

B. TEAM

A team has one administrator and multiple verified members.

C. MISSION

A mission is a shared live tracking session connected to a particular rescue team.

Example:

Team Name: SURAKSHA RESCUE TEAM 01

Mission Name: MATHURA RESCUE OPERATION

Mission ID: MTR-2026-001

Team Admin: Person A

Members:

- Person A
- Person B
- Person C
- Person D
- Person E
- Person F

Every member logs in separately using their own account.

All authorized members join the same mission.

When the mission becomes active, every member sees the same mission and the locations of all other authorized members on their own phones.

All location updates must synchronize in real time.

A member must not have to create a separate mission to see their teammates.

There must be one shared mission session for the entire team.

