6. A removed member cannot read mission locations.
7. A blocked member cannot rejoin through an invitation.
8. Only the Team Admin can reinstate a blocked member.
9. Only authorized members can invite new users.
10. Ordinary members cannot change administrator roles.
11. Ordinary members cannot remove the Team Admin.
12. Only the admin can complete or cancel missions.
13. Location updates must contain valid coordinates.
14. Location updates must contain valid timestamps.
15. Location records must have a valid mission membership.
16. SOS status transitions must be authorized.
17. Members cannot alter other members' GPS coordinates.
18. Members cannot change their own verification status.

The removal restriction must be enforced by backend security rules and trusted server logic, not just frontend code.

